213
00:10:33,333 --> 00:10:34,458
Here.

214
00:10:34,541 --> 00:10:35,583
Liu You-Xin.

215
00:10:36,541 --> 00:10:37,416
Here.

216
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:38,416
Huang Lijuan.

217
