<i>If there's a faraway place</i>

1913
01:42:07,375 --> 01:42:12,458
<i>You are the direction</i>

1914
01:42:12,541 --> 01:42:16,708
<i>Too bad regret always lasts</i>

1915
01:42:16,791 --> 01:42:19,666
<i>Longer than memories</i>

1916
01:42:19,750 --> 01:42:22,625
<i>Longing never ends</i>

1917
01:42:22,708 --> 01:42:25,333
<i>But it carries weight</i>

1918
01:42:25,416 --> 01:42:28,208
<i>The me that once was yours</i>

1919
01:42:28,291 --> 01:42:32,375
<i>I can't forget</i>

1920
01:42:33,708 --> 01:42:37,041
<i>Even for a second</i>

1921
01:42:37,125 --> 01:42:41,625
<i>I'd trade it for forever</i>

1922
01:42:41,708 --> 01:42:48,458
<i>Time will heal our shattered dreams</i>

1923
01:42:49,125 --> 01:42:52,666
<i>Goodbyes are too hard</i>

1924
01:42:52,750 --> 01:42:56,375
<i>Mend the wounds of parting</i>

1925
01:42:56,458 --> 01:42:59,166
<i>May all the heartbreak</i>

1926
01:42:59,250 --> 01:43:04,166
<i>Turn us into sunlight</i>

1927
01:43:18,791 --> 01:43:22,833
<i>I hear happiness</i>

1928
01:43:22,916 --> 01:43:26,083
<i>Happiness singing</i>

1929
01:43:26,166 --> 01:43:30,208
<i>Singing of joy and sorrow</i>

1930
01:43:30,291 --> 01:43:32,458
<i>All returning to the earth</i>

1931
01:43:32,541 --> 01:43:37,500
<i>Like sun and rain, bloom and fade</i>

1932
01:43:37,583 --> 01:43:40,708
<i>I've learned to forgive</i>

1933
01:43:40,791 --> 01:43:44,416
<i>You left your sweetest dream</i>

1934
01:43:44,500 --> 01:43:48,416
<i>Resting in my heart</i>

1935
01:43:48,500 --> 01:43:52,333
<i>I hear happiness</i>

1936
01:43:52,416 --> 01:43:55,666
<i>Happiness singing</i>

1937
01:43:55,750 --> 01:43:59,833
<i>Behind the dark clouds</i>

1938
01:44:00,750 --> 01:44:01,875
<i>Ms. Li Hui-Zhen.</i>

1939
01:44:01,958 --> 01:44:04,458
Do you agree to place your child,
Li Yun-Shi,

1940
01:44:04,541 --> 01:44:07,083
in the care of Ms. Tseng Ya-Han?

1941
01:44:08,333 --> 01:44:09,333
Ms. Tseng.

1942
01:44:10,791 --> 01:44:12,250
Before the adoption,

1943
01:44:12,333 --> 01:44:14,125
may I ask one more favor?

1944
01:44:15,291 --> 01:44:16,583
What is it?

1945
01:44:17,458 --> 01:44:19,791
Please don't let her know

1946
01:44:20,916 --> 01:44:24,416
her mother is a murderer.

1947
01:44:25,666 --> 01:44:27,666
Please.

1948
01:44:34,500 --> 01:44:36,000
Thank you.

1949
01:44:36,083 --> 01:44:37,166
Ms. Li Hui-Zhen.

1950
01:44:38,041 --> 01:44:40,416
If you agree,

1951
01:44:41,208 --> 01:44:44,666
you will no longer have
custody of your child.

1952
01:44:44,750 --> 01:44:45,708
Legally,

1953
01:44:45,791 --> 01:44:47,750
you will no longer be her mother.

1954
01:44:49,000 --> 01:44:50,291
Do you agree?

1955
01:44:54,375 --> 01:44:55,250
I do.

1956
01:44:57,916 --> 01:45:00,791
<i>If there's a heaven in this world</i>

1957
01:45:00,875 --> 01:45:06,750
<i>You are by my side right now</i>

1958
01:45:06,833 --> 01:45:13,250
<i>Never once forgotten</i>

1959
01:45:15,250 --> 01:45:20,958
<i>I hear happiness, happiness singing</i>

1960
01:45:21,041 --> 01:45:27,375
<i>Singing of joy and sorrow</i>
<i>all returning to the earth</i>

1961
01:45:27,458 --> 01:45:32,166
<i>Like sun and rain, bloom and fade</i>

1962
01:45:33,041 --> 01:45:35,750
<i>I've learned to forgive</i>

1963
01:45:35,833 --> 01:45:39,458
<i>You left your sweetest dream</i>

1964
01:45:39,541 --> 01:45:42,750
<i>Resting in my heart</i>

1965
01:45:43,625 --> 01:45:50,541
<i>I embrace the past and unhealed wounds</i>

1966
01:45:50,625 --> 01:45:56,708
<i>I wipe the tears and promise</i>
<i>not to forget</i>

1967
01:45:56,791 --> 01:46:00,875
<i>Love is an eternal light</i>

1968
01:46:00,958 --> 01:46:06,666
<i>-Guarding by your side</i>
<i>-By mine</i>

1969
01:46:06,750 --> 01:46:13,750
<i>Never once forgotten</i>

1970
01:46:13,833 --> 01:46:17,958
<i>I have never</i>

1971
01:46:20,666 --> 01:46:24,333
<i>Forgotten.</i>

1972
01:46:54,375 --> 01:46:55,791
<i>Sir.</i>

1973
01:46:56,500 --> 01:46:57,875
We could…

1974
01:46:57,958 --> 01:47:00,041
get in touch with Caring Children's Home,

1975
01:47:00,125 --> 01:47:01,958
and bring the girl named Yun-Shi.

1976
01:47:02,833 --> 01:47:05,291
The last event was such a success,

1977
01:47:05,375 --> 01:47:06,541
so I was thinking,

1978
01:47:06,625 --> 01:47:08,541
if we let mother and daughter reunite,

1979
01:47:08,625 --> 01:47:10,166
it'll surely draw attention.

1980
01:47:10,250 --> 01:47:12,083
Good idea.

1981
01:47:12,166 --> 01:47:13,541
Then it's decided.

1982
01:47:23,041 --> 01:47:24,708
Yun-Shi.

1983
01:47:24,791 --> 01:47:27,166
You were amazing just now.

1984
01:47:27,250 --> 01:47:29,000
My name isn't Yun-Shi.

1985
01:47:29,083 --> 01:47:32,500
I'm Tseng Zi-Ching.

1986
01:47:35,666 --> 01:47:37,166
Right.

1987
01:47:38,500 --> 01:47:39,583
Zi-Ching.

1988
01:47:40,750 --> 01:47:42,208
What a cute name.

1989
01:47:44,625 --> 01:47:46,916
Can I give you a hug?

1990
01:47:47,000 --> 01:47:48,416
Mom, is that okay?

1991
01:47:52,083 --> 01:47:53,458
Of course.

1992
01:47:53,541 --> 01:47:55,250
Just like we practiced before.

1993
01:47:55,333 --> 01:47:56,375
Okay.

1994
01:48:05,458 --> 01:48:08,625
Auntie, I love you.

1995
01:48:10,958 --> 01:48:12,791
I love you too.

1996
01:48:16,708 --> 01:48:17,875
Thank you.

1997
01:48:26,375 --> 01:48:27,791
This flower pin,

1998
01:48:29,000 --> 01:48:30,625
can I give it to her?

1999
01:48:30,708 --> 01:48:34,083
As a keepsake of our duet.

2000
01:48:34,791 --> 01:48:35,791
Can I?

2001
01:48:38,625 --> 01:48:40,291
You can have this.

2002
01:48:42,416 --> 01:48:43,958
Do you like it?

2003
01:48:45,416 --> 01:48:48,000
This is the only thing I can give you.

2004
01:48:48,791 --> 01:48:50,416
I hope you like it.

2005
01:48:54,333 --> 01:48:55,916
Thank you.

2006
01:49:00,791 --> 01:49:03,000
Thank you for treating her eye.

2007
01:49:04,541 --> 01:49:06,250
I promised you.

2008
01:49:11,083 --> 01:49:12,791
Zi-Ching, let's go.

2009
01:49:19,458 --> 01:49:21,041
Bye-bye.

2010
01:49:22,291 --> 01:49:23,541
Bye-bye.

2011
01:50:18,208 --> 01:50:20,666
-One.
-Two.

2012
01:50:20,750 --> 01:50:22,083
-Three.
-Four.

2013
01:50:22,208 --> 01:50:23,666
-One.
-Two.

2014
01:50:23,750 --> 01:50:24,875
-Three.
-Four.

2015
01:50:25,000 --> 01:50:26,000
Five.

2016
01:50:26,708 --> 01:50:27,958
-One.
-Two.

2017
01:50:28,041 --> 01:50:29,375
-One.
-Two.

2018
01:50:29,458 --> 01:50:30,291
-Three.
-Four.

2019
01:50:30,375 --> 01:50:31,666
Five. One.

2020
01:50:31,750 --> 01:50:32,625
-Two.
-Three.

2021
01:50:32,708 --> 01:50:33,833
Headcount complete.

2022
01:50:33,916 --> 01:50:35,541
All right, Workshop Two. Open up.

2023
01:50:35,625 --> 01:50:36,583
Move forward.

2024
01:50:39,166 --> 01:50:41,250
Sis, what's wrong?

2025
01:50:41,375 --> 01:50:42,625
Grandma.

2026
01:50:42,708 --> 01:50:44,291
Everybody down. No sudden moves.

2027
01:50:45,000 --> 01:50:47,791
8024, what's wrong?
8024.

2028
01:50:47,875 --> 01:50:49,375
Workshop Two calling Central.

2029
01:50:49,458 --> 01:50:53,375
8024 has fainted. Requesting support.

2030
01:51:15,708 --> 01:51:17,291
{\an8}Grandma, you're awake.

2031
01:51:20,625 --> 01:51:23,541
I called your daughter.

2032
01:51:25,208 --> 01:51:27,041
She's on her way.

2033
01:51:31,333 --> 01:51:33,208
Yu-Wen. A visitor.

2034
01:51:35,208 --> 01:51:36,666
Grandma.

2035
01:51:36,750 --> 01:51:38,625
I'll go get her.

2036
01:51:41,166 --> 01:51:42,000
Wait for me.

2037
01:52:02,750 --> 01:52:03,791
Attention, everyone.

2038
01:52:04,333 --> 01:52:05,166
Headcount.

2039
01:52:05,250 --> 01:52:06,583
-One.
-Two.

2040
01:52:06,666 --> 01:52:07,833
-Three.
-Four.

2041
01:52:23,125 --> 01:52:24,166
Supervisor.

2042
01:52:24,916 --> 01:52:26,416
How's Sis?

2043
01:52:26,500 --> 01:52:27,750
Why isn't she back?

2044
01:52:30,083 --> 01:52:30,916
Hey.

2045
01:52:32,916 --> 01:52:34,416
Why are you packing up?

2046
01:52:34,500 --> 01:52:35,958
Don't pack up her things.

2047
01:52:36,041 --> 01:52:38,083
Grandma will come back.

2048
01:52:38,166 --> 01:52:40,250
-Why pack up?
-Don't.

2049
01:52:40,333 --> 01:52:43,041
-She'll be back.
-Don't pack up.

2050
01:52:43,125 --> 01:52:43,958
Supervisor.

2051
01:52:44,041 --> 01:52:45,166
Don't pack up.

2052
01:52:47,708 --> 01:52:48,541
8112.

2053
01:53:00,291 --> 01:53:01,541
Sis.

2054
01:53:01,625 --> 01:53:02,958
She's not coming back.

2055
01:53:27,125 --> 01:53:29,250
8024 wrote this for all of you.

2056
01:53:35,041 --> 01:53:36,500
Grandma.

2057
01:53:39,875 --> 01:53:42,125
Was Grandma in pain at the end?

2058
01:53:46,958 --> 01:53:48,416
Continue.

2059
01:53:48,500 --> 01:53:50,833
Was she in a lot of pain?

2060
01:53:57,041 --> 01:53:59,416
Grandma.

2061
01:54:37,875 --> 01:54:40,458
<i>My dear daughter, Mei-Hua.</i>

2062
01:54:41,833 --> 01:54:43,416
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

2063
01:54:44,833 --> 01:54:46,208
<i>I'm really, really sorry.</i>

2064
01:54:47,333 --> 01:54:48,583
I'll get the doctor.

2065
01:54:49,583 --> 01:54:52,500
<i>I don't expect you to forgive me.</i>

2066
01:54:53,208 --> 01:54:54,291
<i>I only hope</i>

2067
01:54:54,375 --> 01:54:56,500
<i>you can be happy.</i>

2068
01:54:58,291 --> 01:55:00,125
<i>As a mother,</i>

2069
01:55:00,208 --> 01:55:03,250
<i>not giving you the love you deserved</i>

2070
01:55:03,333 --> 01:55:05,583
<i>is my life's biggest regret.</i>

2071
01:55:08,916 --> 01:55:10,791
<i>For the past 30 years,</i>

2072
01:55:10,875 --> 01:55:12,500
<i>I've never stopped</i>

2073
01:55:12,583 --> 01:55:14,708
<i>feeling remorse.</i>

2074
01:55:16,041 --> 01:55:17,333
Mom.

2075
01:55:17,416 --> 01:55:20,000
<i>But I've also never stopped</i>

2076
01:55:20,875 --> 01:55:23,375
<i>loving you deeply.</i>

2077
01:55:29,625 --> 01:55:31,708
Keep these safe.

2078
01:55:32,291 --> 01:55:34,333
Give them only to Grandma, okay?

2079
01:55:43,125 --> 01:55:44,375
This necklace.

2080
01:55:47,083 --> 01:55:49,250
Grandma passed it to Mom.

2081
01:55:49,333 --> 01:55:52,166
If anything happens in the future,

2082
01:55:53,041 --> 01:55:55,666
at least this necklace will protect you.

2083
01:55:56,166 --> 01:55:57,291
Understand?

2084
01:56:26,375 --> 01:56:29,291
<i>Those I once loved</i>

2085
01:56:29,375 --> 01:56:32,791
<i>Are you doing well now?</i>

2086
01:56:32,875 --> 01:56:38,250
<i>Do you still remember me?</i>

2087
01:56:39,041 --> 01:56:41,666
<i>The ones I couldn't let go</i>

2088
01:56:41,750 --> 01:56:44,208
<i>Dear sisters,</i>

2089
01:56:44,291 --> 01:56:46,958
<i>when you read this letter,</i>

2090
01:56:47,041 --> 01:56:50,333
<i>I'll be at life's end.</i>

2091
01:56:51,750 --> 01:56:53,458
<i>I thought</i>

2092
01:56:53,541 --> 01:56:54,750
<i>the rest of my life</i>

2093
01:56:54,833 --> 01:56:57,708
<i>was doomed to be dim.</i>

2094
01:56:58,458 --> 01:57:00,625
<i>But because of you,</i>

2095
01:57:00,708 --> 01:57:03,000
<i>because of our choir,</i>

2096
01:57:03,708 --> 01:57:05,750
<i>My final days were</i>

2097
01:57:05,833 --> 01:57:08,291
<i>still filled with happiness.</i>

2098
01:57:08,375 --> 01:57:12,291
<i>Till we meet again, take my hand</i>

2099
01:57:12,375 --> 01:57:15,541
<i>Sisters, I wasted too much time</i>

2100
01:57:15,625 --> 01:57:17,625
<i>living in hate.</i>

2101
01:57:18,666 --> 01:57:20,416
<i>And I forgot</i>

2102
01:57:20,500 --> 01:57:24,708
<i>I was always surrounded by love.</i>

2103
01:57:24,791 --> 01:57:28,458
<i>I want to continue on with you</i>

2104
01:57:28,541 --> 01:57:30,958
<i>But time always reaches</i>

2105
01:57:31,041 --> 01:57:36,875
<i>The end too soon</i>

2106
01:57:44,208 --> 01:57:45,541
<i>Maybe</i>

2107
01:57:45,625 --> 01:57:47,291
<i>we may never</i>

2108
01:57:47,375 --> 01:57:49,041
<i>undo our mistakes.</i>

2109
01:57:50,333 --> 01:57:52,625
<i>But please don't forget</i>

2110
01:57:54,000 --> 01:57:55,791
<i>we still have</i>

2111
01:57:55,875 --> 01:57:57,625
<i>the ability to love.</i>

2112
01:58:00,041 --> 01:58:03,083
<i>Till we meet again</i>

2113
01:58:03,666 --> 01:58:06,375
<i>Take my hand</i>

2114
01:58:06,458 --> 01:58:09,958
<i>Under a bright sky</i>

2115
01:58:10,041 --> 01:58:13,208
<i>It will hold us both</i>

2116
01:58:13,291 --> 01:58:16,166
<i>Love is like a gust of wind</i>

2117
01:58:16,250 --> 01:58:20,166
<i>Teaching us to let go</i>

2118
01:58:20,250 --> 01:58:22,333
<i>We never quite learn to part</i>

2119
01:58:22,416 --> 01:58:25,708
<i>But we learned</i>

2120
01:58:25,791 --> 01:58:28,416
<i>To let go</i>

2121
01:58:29,291 --> 01:58:32,291
<i>The ones we can't bear to lose</i>

2122
01:58:32,375 --> 01:58:34,625
<i>Life is far too short.</i>

2123
01:58:36,291 --> 01:58:40,125
<i>Cherish every chance to love and be loved.</i>

2124
01:58:42,125 --> 01:58:46,250
<i>May you and those you hold dear</i>

2125
01:58:47,125 --> 01:58:48,125
<i>find the way</i>

2126
01:58:48,208 --> 01:58:50,125
<i>till we meet again.</i>

2127
01:59:14,458 --> 01:59:18,291
TO ZI-CHING

2128
01:59:22,875 --> 01:59:27,541
{\an8}Dear Zi-Ching, sorry I can't make
your graduation show.

2129
01:59:27,625 --> 01:59:30,958
{\an8}Happy 18th birthday. My gift to you.

2130
01:59:54,125 --> 01:59:56,041
Why a piano?

2131
01:59:57,875 --> 02:00:00,333
She doesn't even know I play guitar.

2132
02:00:09,125 --> 02:00:12,375
DID YOU SEE THE GIFT?

2133
02:00:12,458 --> 02:00:14,875
MM.

2134
02:00:14,958 --> 02:00:20,416
I'M SORRY IT TURNED OUT LIKE THIS.

2135
02:00:20,500 --> 02:00:21,500
Hot latte.

2136
02:00:21,583 --> 02:00:22,416
THANKS MOM

2137
02:00:22,500 --> 02:00:24,166
A latte. Okay.

2138
02:00:24,250 --> 02:00:25,083
You?

2139
02:00:25,166 --> 02:00:26,208
She wants a yogurt.

2140
02:00:26,291 --> 02:00:28,208
Yogurt, okay, please wait.

2141
02:00:28,666 --> 02:00:29,500
How is it?

2142
02:00:29,583 --> 02:00:31,375
Did she read the card?

2143
02:00:33,958 --> 02:00:34,958
Ya-Han.

2144
02:00:35,041 --> 02:00:37,875
I really don't think you should
lie to her.

2145
02:00:37,958 --> 02:00:38,875
Then what can I do?

2146
02:00:38,958 --> 02:00:40,916
Tell her the truth.

2147
02:00:41,000 --> 02:00:43,125
She'll find out sooner or later.

2148
02:00:43,208 --> 02:00:46,041
But I promised Li Hui-Zhen I wouldn't.

2149
02:00:47,875 --> 02:00:48,833
Excuse me.

2150
02:00:50,083 --> 02:00:51,000
I got it.

2151
02:00:52,166 --> 02:00:53,000
How many?

2152
02:00:53,083 --> 02:00:54,000
One.

2153
02:01:01,000 --> 02:01:01,916
Your mail.

2154
02:01:02,000 --> 02:01:03,083
Coming.

2155
02:01:04,166 --> 02:01:05,083
For Tseng Ya-Han.

2156
02:01:05,166 --> 02:01:06,583
She's not here.

2157
02:01:06,666 --> 02:01:08,250
Do you have her seal?

2158
02:01:39,375 --> 02:01:40,958
Yun-Shi…

2159
02:02:47,125 --> 02:02:49,583
AN ATTACK BREAKS OUT
AT NORTHERN WOMEN'S PRISON

2160
02:03:02,208 --> 02:03:03,916
Chief Fang, I'm going to kill you.

2161
02:03:19,958 --> 02:03:21,750
Hui-Zhen.

2162
02:03:21,833 --> 02:03:23,500
Why is there so much bleeding?

2163
02:03:24,958 --> 02:03:25,916
Central, backup.

2164
02:03:26,000 --> 02:03:28,541
Chief Fang here.
Send an ambulance to the auditorium.

2165
02:03:28,625 --> 02:03:29,875
ASAP.

2166
02:03:29,958 --> 02:03:33,166
<i>An attack breaks out</i>
<i>at Northern Women's Prison.</i>

2167
02:03:33,250 --> 02:03:34,750
<i>A newly admitted inmate,</i>

2168
02:03:34,833 --> 02:03:37,583
<i>during choir tryouts,</i>

2169
02:03:37,666 --> 02:03:39,000
<i>attacked prison staff</i>

2170
02:03:39,083 --> 02:03:40,875
<i>with a sharp weapon.</i>

2171
02:03:40,958 --> 02:03:42,833
<i>The choir leader who stopped the attack</i>

2172
02:03:42,916 --> 02:03:45,333
<i>was seriously injured</i>
<i>and taken to the hospital.</i>

2173
02:03:45,416 --> 02:03:47,541
